s the 3) man working out. However, I'd like her to be visibly breathing out through her mouth, with a drop of sweat on her cheek and on her stomach. Please add a bit of blush to her nose.\n\nI would like her to only be wearing this 2) sports bra and 1) shorts. I would like a hole in the workout chair so that her tail can go through the back.\n\nFor the background, I would like the walls to be matching the design of the walls of the  4) screenshot, one gold wall and one white wall with a black line. \n\nI have included references of Silence Suzuka if you need them. Thank you for your time!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/bj0TNTh", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@258n_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1063686, "client_id": 854948, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/44801f1c/uploads/origins/25452d53-627c-4f3f-9f10-7001ecd052c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=358a215933f0f8a25255e539bff90c03", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/44801f1c/uploads/origins/25452d53-627c-4f3f-9f10-7001ecd052c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=358a215933f0f8a25255e539bff90c03, https://si.imgix.net/44801f1c/uploads/origins/25452d53-627c-4f3f-9f10-7001ecd052c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d2f59ea0a189d85c3f8c5b6bc8cfdf2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/44801f1c/uploads/origins/25452d53-627c-4f3f-9f10-7001ecd052c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f0dec7445ccaca0aad2f0cc59451e3e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/44801f1c/uploads/origins/25452d53-627c-4f3f-9f10-7001ecd052c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e06cc25f3b7677be7be